    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wallpaper or paint? Tiles or laminate? Floor lamps or sconces? The choice is yours! A wide range of decorative elements will allow you to create the desired atmosphere of the restaurant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees or take them away from a competitor. Set up pay and work schedule. Raise the qualifications of your staff and unlock their potential. <br>Unlock new dishes and make the menu the way you see fit.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cooks need ingredients and utensils, and your cleaners need chemistry. Keep track of the amount of goods in stock and buy new ones on time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Problem situations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue is the best way to avoid conflict. Deal with dissatisfied customers and make difficult decisions, but be prepared for unexpected results.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Promotion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From petty mischief to burglary: what can you do to ruin a rival restaurant's reputation? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist so you don't miss the release!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1728910843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1728910843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1728910843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wallpaper or paint? Tiles or laminate? Floor lamps or sconces? The choice is yours! A wide range of decorative elements will allow you to create the desired atmosphere of the restaurant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees or take them away from a competitor. Set up pay and work schedule. Raise the qualifications of your staff and unlock their potential. <br>Unlock new dishes and make the menu the way you see fit.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cooks need ingredients and utensils, and your cleaners need chemistry. Keep track of the amount of goods in stock and buy new ones on time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Problem situations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue is the best way to avoid conflict. Deal with dissatisfied customers and make difficult decisions, but be prepared for unexpected results.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Promotion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From petty mischief to burglary: what can you do to ruin a rival restaurant's reputation? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist so you don't miss the release!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1728910843\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1728910843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375600/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1728910843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Challenge yourself as a novice restaurateur in the face of existing competition. Open your establishment, decorate it according to your taste, manage staff and control purchases. Do everything to become the best, using honest and not very ways!",
